                            <div id="elementor-tab-content-2382" className="eael-accordion-content clearfix" data-tab="2" aria-labelledby="loss-of-interest-or-pleasure-">
                              <p>Activities that used to bring happiness and joy may no longer hold any appeal during these episodes. The person may find themselves disengaged and emotionally disconnected from the things they once loved. This is clinically described as anhedonia.</p>
                            </div>
